## Useful Verification Commands
Check the ERSPAN session:

```
show monitor session 1
```

Check routing:

```
show ip route
```

Check OSPF neighbors:

```
show ip ospf neighbor
```

Test reachability from CSR4 to CSR5:

```
ping 10.10.40.5 source 10.10.30.4
```

